1
00:08:38,571 --> 00:08:44,571
Us united.

2
00:17:17,142 --> 00:17:23,142
Zack Snyder's Justice League is a action, adventure,
fantasy film directed by Zack Snyder.

3
00:25:55,714 --> 00:26:01,714
Determined to ensure Superman's ultimate sacrifice was not in vain, Bruce Wayne aligns forces with Diana Prince with plans
to recruit a team of metahumans to protect the world from an approaching threat of catastrophic proportions.

4
00:34:34,285 --> 00:34:40,285
Batman / Bruce Wayne, played by Ben Affleck.

5
00:43:12,857 --> 00:43:18,857
Superman / Clark Kent, played by Henry Cavill.

6
00:51:51,428 --> 00:51:57,428
Wonder Woman / Diana Prince, played by Gal Gadot.

7
01:00:30,000 --> 01:00:36,000
Cyborg / Victor Stone, played by Ray Fisher.

8
01:09:08,571 --> 01:09:14,571
Aquaman / Arthur Curry, played by Jason Momoa.

9
01:17:47,142 --> 01:17:53,142
The Flash / Barry Allen, played by Ezra Miller.

10
01:26:25,714 --> 01:26:31,714
Zack Snyder's Justice League is the 2021 director's cut and the original version of the 2017 American superhero film Justice League,
the fifth film set within the DC Extended Universe (DCEU), which is based on the team of the same name appearing in DC.

11
01:35:04,285 --> 01:35:10,285
It is director Zack Snyder's original vision of the film
prior to his departure from the production.

12
01:43:42,857 --> 01:43:48,857
The film follows Batman (Ben Affleck), Wonder Woman (Gal Gadot), Cyborg (Ray Fisher), Aquaman (Jason Momoa), the Flash (Ezra Miller), and Superman (Henry Cavill) as they form an
alliance to stop the extradimensional New God Steppenwolf (Ciarán Hinds) and his army of Parademons from conquering Earth for his overlord, Darkseid (Ray Porter).

13
01:52:21,428 --> 01:52:27,428
The production of the theatrical film was difficult, and the
script frequently underwent major changes.

14
02:01:00,000 --> 02:01:06,000
In May 2017, Snyder stepped down during production following the death of his daughter, and Joss
Whedon was hired to finish the film, completing it as an uncredited additional director.

15
02:09:38,571 --> 02:09:44,571
Whedon wrote and directed new sequences and incorporated a brighter, more humorous tone while
significantly reducing the runtime in accordance with directives from Warner Bros.

16
02:18:17,142 --> 02:18:23,142
The theatrical version polarized critics and underperformed
at the box office, resulting in Warner Bros.

17
02:26:55,714 --> 02:27:01,714
developing future DCEU films around individual characters
with less emphasis on a wider shared universe.

18
02:35:34,285 --> 02:35:40,285
Many people expressed interest in Snyder's version of the film,
often colloquially referred to as the Snyder Cut.

19
02:44:12,857 --> 02:44:18,857
Although most industry insiders reported its release unlikely, Warner Bros.

20
02:52:51,428 --> 02:52:57,428
moved ahead with it in February 2020.

21
03:01:30,000 --> 03:01:36,000
In May 2020, Snyder announced it would be released as
Zack Snyder's Justice League on HBO Max.

22
03:10:08,571 --> 03:10:14,571
$70 million was spent to complete the visual effects, score, and
editing, with new material being shot in October 2020.

23
03:18:47,142 --> 03:18:53,142
The film is dedicated to the memory of Autumn Snyder.

24
03:27:25,714 --> 03:27:31,714
Zack Snyder's Justice League was released on HBO Max in
the United States on March 18, 2021.

25
03:36:04,285 --> 03:36:10,285
It became the fourth-most-streamed film on the platform that year.

26
03:44:42,857 --> 03:44:48,857
The film was released to positive reviews from critics, who generally considered it
better than the theatrical cut, but criticised the lengthy runtime.

27
03:53:21,428 --> 03:53:27,428
The film explores themes of saving the world, superhero,
resurrection, based on comic, superhero team.
